---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Valorferrum | Performance Marketing Freelancer"
  description="Performance Marketing & Martech freelancer with agency experience. No excess profit - only value-driven work. Specialized in SMEs, startups & NGOs."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Hero: Image + Bio -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="aspect-square max-w-sm mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-spectrum-pink to-spectrum-blue p-1">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-surface flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-8xl font-display font-bold text-text-primary">V</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal space-y-6">
          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary">About</h1>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg">Value-driven digitalization from a single source.</p>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">I'm a freelancer for performance marketing, martech and data-driven digital strategy. With agency experience, but without agency overhead.</p>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">My focus is on SMEs, startups and NGOs - organizations that want more than quick fixes. I work fair, transparent and self-sustaining.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-sm font-medium">SEO</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-pink/10 text-spectrum-pink text-sm font-medium">SEA</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-blue/10 text-spectrum-blue text-sm font-medium">Web Development</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-yellow/10 text-spectrum-yellow text-sm font-medium">Tracking</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What sets me apart -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">What sets me apart</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">
          I combine technical performance, marketing performance and entrepreneurial performance
          in one person. That means: no communication gaps between development and marketing,
          no endless coordination rounds between departments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- My approach -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">My approach</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">All-in-one:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Developer + Marketer + Analyst in one person</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Agency experience without overhead:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> No account managers, no unnecessary processes</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Value-driven work:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Fair price, no excess profit, focus on NGOs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Self-sustaining rather than profit-maximized:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Sustainability over growth at any price</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Values -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">Values</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Direct</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Speak clearly, without sugarcoating. Honest assessment instead of sales talk.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Transparent</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Prices understandable, services honestly assessed. No hidden costs.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Self-critical</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Know your own limits and stand by them. Say "no" when something doesn't make sense.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Value-driven</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Don't sell products that aren't needed. Fair price instead of maximum price.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="reveal text-center p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">Let's get to know each other</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">No sales pitch. Just an honest conversation.</p>
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-spectrum-pink text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-primary/25">
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>